ass=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">ZM</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Zanele Mkhize</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/ekurhuleni\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">ekurhuleni</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">NM</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Noluthando Mgwenya</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/kempton-park\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">kempton-park</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">LT</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Lesego Tau</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/vanderbijlpark\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">vanderbijlpark</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">LM</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Lerato Mokoena</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/pretoria\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">pretoria</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">TM</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Thabo Molefe</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/johannesburg\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">johannesburg</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Community voices</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5px;margin:10px 0\">Stories from <!-- -->Gauteng</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:14px\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;font-family:var(--display)\">How I Found My First Job Through Ubuntu Town</div><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem;margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6\">Thembi from Soweto used the opportunity board to find NYDA placement.</p><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted2);font-style:italic\">— <!-- -->Thembi M.</span><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\" style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--gold-deep);text-decoration:none\">johannesburg<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The Ecosystem</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5px;margin:10px 0\">Ubuntu Town products across <!-- -->Gauteng</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92px;margin-bottom:18px;max-width:600px\">Every town in <!-- -->Gauteng<!-- --> has access to these ecosystem products. Enter a town to claim an opportunity.</p><div class=\"ecogrid\"><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🔧</div><div class=\"en\">FixEasy24</div><div class=\"ed\">Get verified as a service provider — plumber, electrician, handyman</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🛒</div><div class=\"en\">KasiBuy</div><div class=\"ed\">List your spaza or shop on the local marketplace</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">📷</div><div class=\"en\">FrameSouth</div><div class=\"ed\">Become the town&#x27;s photographer — document, prove, earn</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">💻</div><div class=\"en\">AI Café</div><div class=\"ed\">Partner to bring AI and internet access to your community</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎵</div><div class=\"en\">Orbit Music</div><div class=\"ed\">Create music with AI — workshops and tools</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎙️</div><div class=\"en\">Inside.Town</div><div class=\"ed\">Host a podcast — tell your town&#x27;s story</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🏠</div><div class=\"en\">FamilyHouse</div><div class=\"ed\">Host visitors in your home — earn from hospitality</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🍺</div><div class=\"en\">BuntuBar</div><div class=\"ed\">Mobile bar and beverage workshop — events economy</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The model</span><h2 style=\"margin:12px;font-size:1.6px\">One loop runs every town.</h2><div class=\"loopline\" style=\"justify-content:center;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)\">Signal<span class=\"a\">→</span>Workpack<span class=\"a\">→</span>Proof<span class=\"a\">→</span>Memory<span class=\"a\">→</span>Action</div><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:16px auto 0\">As coordinators run the loop, towns render — and the province lights up.</p></section></div><footer class=\"site\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"logo\"><div class=\"mark\">🏘️</div><div><div class=\"wm\" style=\"color:var(--creamhi)\">Ubuntu Town</div><div class=\"tg\">Abantu Bo Buntu</div></div></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:660px\">Illustrative Gauteng rollout state — town names, regions and districts are real; status, render_pct and potential are demo values until each twin is built. No live twin yet (Free State is the reference build).<!-- --> · light CI · enter.ubuntutown.co.za</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\" data-react-aria-top-layer=\"true\"></section><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2c226e022979f4f0.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><style>\n#nprogress {\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n#nprogress .bar {\n  background: #6B1F66;\n\n  position: fixed;\n  z-index: 99999;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Fancy blur effect */\n#nprogress .peg {\n  display: block;\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0px;\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #6B1F66, 0 0 5px #6B1F66;\n