.Town — Community Podcast Producer\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-carletonville\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"inside_town\"}}],\"cv_count\":1},{\"slug\":\"vanderbijlpark\",\"name\":\"Vanderbijlpark\",\"region\":\"\",\"status\":\"building\",\"render_pct\":15,\"opportunity_potential\":45,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/vanderbijlpark\",\"illustrative\":false,\"coordinator_name\":\"Lesego Tau\",\"youth_mapped\":0,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":0,\"lat\":-26.7,\"lng\":27.8,\"description\":\"Steel city on the Vaal River, home to ArcelorMittal's largest South African plant.\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-fram-vanderbijlpark\",\"title\":\"FrameSouth — Town Photographer / Visual Proof Creator\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-vanderbijlpark\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"framesouth\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-fixe-vanderbijlpark-2\",\"title\":\"FixEasy24 — Verified Service Provider Registration\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-vanderbijlpark\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"fixeasy24\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-kasi-vanderbijlpark-3\",\"title\":\"KasiBuy — Local Spaza / WhatsApp Store Listing\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-vanderbijlpark\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"kasibuy\"}}],\"cv_count\":1},{\"slug\":\"sandton\",\"name\":\"Sandton\",\"region\":\"business hub\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-26.1075,\"lng\":28.0526,\"description\":\"Africa's richest square mile, Sandton is where global finance meets African ambition — the Johannesburg Stock Exchange, luxury hotels, and the iconic Nelson Mandela Square anchor South Africa's financial capital.\",\"population_estimate\":220000,\"archetype\":\"business_hub\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/sandton\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"midrand\",\"name\":\"Midrand\",\"region\":\"business hub\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.9964,\"lng\":28.1286,\"description\":\"Between Johannesburg and Pretoria, Midrand is a conference and business hub centred around Gallagher Convention Centre and the rapidly developing Waterfall City development.\",\"population_estimate\":150000,\"archetype\":\"business_hub\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/midrand\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"mabopane\",\"name\":\"Mabopane\",\"region\":\"township\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.4833,\"lng\":27.85,\"description\":\"A township in the north of Pretoria, Mabopane is a community where youth entrepreneurship and community resilience define daily life.\",\"population_estimate\":280000,\"archetype\":\"township\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/mabopane\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"mamelodi\",\"name\":\"Mamelodi\",\"region\":\"township\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.7167,\"lng\":28.3333,\"description\":\"East of Pretoria, Mamelodi is a vibrant township with a rich musical heritage — it's produced some of South Africa's finest mbaqanga and kwaito artists.\",\"population_estimate\":350000,\"archetype\":\"township\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/mamelodi\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"soshanguve\",\"name\":\"Soshanguve\",\"region\":\"township\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.4333,\"lng\":28.1,\"description\":\"North of Pretoria, Soshanguve is a large township built in the 1970s that has grown into a community with its own identity, markets, and cultural events.\",\"population_estimate\":400000,\"archetype\":\"township\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/soshanguve\",\"illustrative\":true}],\"hero_image\":\"https://i